**DIRAC
.TITLE
 BH+ (5 el.)
.WAVE FUNCTION
.4INDEX
**GENERAL
! Direct evaluation of two-electron integrals
.DIRECT
1 1 1
**INTEGRALS
.PRINT
1
.NUCMOD ! 1-Point nucleus, 2-gaussian
2
*TWOINT
**HAMILTONIAN
.BSS
2999
.PRINT
2
**WAVE FUNCTIONS ! What method (DHF,MP2,CC..)
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL ! DHF specifications...
.CLOSED SHELL
4 0 
.OPEN SHELL
1
1/2
.INTFLG ! Specify what 2-el.integrals to include
1 1 0
.EVCCNV ! Energy convergence...
1.0E-9  1.0D-7
**MOLTRA
# ... take all orbitals ...
.ACTIVE
energy -1000.0 1000.0 1.0
**RELCCSD
.FOCKSP
.PRINT
2
*CCFSPC
.DOEXC
.NACTH
 3 3 
.NACTP
 10 10
.MAXIT
100
*END OF

